    {"id":"weak_still_to_strong_still","label":"衰静 → 旺静","attacker":{"motion":"静","strength":"休囚"},"target":{"motion":"静","strength":"旺相"},"relation":"生／克","allowed":false,"rule":"衰静伤不得旺静","note":"休囚静爻不能反向生克旺相静爻。"},
